  message: "Fixed in PR #4265 (merged origin/dev 416ee26a70). All 4 residual non-canonical stable_id producers canonicalized hash-to-canonical: sparql (3 sites) + kdl -> make_doc_stable_id; graphql client linker -> stable_id=None (populate_synthetic_class_b_identity stamps canonical injective id, fixing the latent operation_name collision); scip -> _short_sha256(moniker) (moniker preserved in meta[scip_symbol]). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: 3942 tests pass, 100% coverage on changed files; per-producer canonical-stable_id assertions added (incl. graphql no-collision test: two same-name ops in different files now get distinct stable_ids); 3 old id==stable_id test pins updated. Symbol.id unchanged. Investigation wf_c26241d9-384 settled hash-to-canonical over exempt (stable_id is a foreign key w/ HARD uniqueness check; scip has a real language)."  # f70f
